# --- Local-only secrets ---
# .env isn't actually read anywhere in this project (no build step to inject
# it) — it's a leftover. Safe to ignore.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# NOTE: config.js is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It's loaded directly by index.html (<script src="config.js">) and holds
# the Web3Forms access key the contact form needs at runtime. If you
# gitignore it, your deployed site won't have it and the contact form will
# stop working. Web3Forms keys are meant to live in client-side code (they
# can only send mail to your configured inbox, not read anything), so
# there's no real security downside to committing it — if you'd still
# rather keep it out of public view, make the GitHub repo private instead.

# --- Dependencies (only relevant if you ever run `npm install` for `serve`) ---
/node_modules
package-lock.json

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.log

# --- Vercel ---
.vercel

# --- Misc backups ---
project.zip
*.srcmap.json
.thumbnail.jpg
